  "content": "# Chips\n\nUse chips to enter information, make selections, filter content, or trigger actions.\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { CheckIcon } from \"lucide-react\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n\t<!-- A standard chip -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600 hover:preset-tonal\">\n\t\tChip\n\t</button>\n\n\t<!-- A chip + icon -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600 hover:preset-tonal\">\n\t\t<span>Chip</span>\n\t\t<CheckIcon size={14} />\n\t</button>\n\n\t<!-- A simple icon chip -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-icon preset-outlined-surface-400-600 hover:preset-tonal\">\n\t\t<CheckIcon size={14} />\n\t</button>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Assist Chips\n\nRepresent a group of related contextual choices.\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport AlarmClockIcon from \"@lucide/svelte/icons/alarm-clock\";\n\timport AppWindowIcon from \"@lucide/svelte/icons/app-window\";\n\timport SunIcon from \"@lucide/svelte/icons/sun\";\n</script>\n\n<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 w-full max-w-md space-y-4 overflow-hidden p-4\">\n\t<header>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"h6\">Home Automation</h2>\n\t</header>\n\t<article class=\"space-y-4\">\n\t\t<p class=\"opacity-60\">\n\t\t\tControl your smart home with a single tap. Choose one of the quick actions below to get\n\t\t\tstarted.\n\t\t</p>\n\t</article>\n\t<hr class=\"hr\" />\n\t<footer class=\"flex [scrollbar-width:none] items-center justify-start gap-2 overflow-x-auto\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<SunIcon size={14} />\n\t\t\t<span>Turn on lights</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<AlarmClockIcon size={14} />\n\t\t\t<span>Set alarm</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<AppWindowIcon size={14} />\n\t\t\t<span>Close blinds</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t</footer>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Filter Chips\n\nRepresent a canned selection of options to choose from.\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport CheckIcon from \"@lucide/svelte/icons/check\";\n\n\tconst colors = [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"];\n\tlet color = $state(colors[0]);\n\n\tfunction setColor(selectedColor: string) {\n\t\tcolor = selectedColor;\n\t}\n</script>\n\n<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 w-full max-w-md p-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n\t\t<span class=\"text-sm opacity-60\">Favorite Color</span>\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t\t{#each colors as c (c)}\n\t\t\t<button\n\t\t\t\tclass={`chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600 capitalize ${color === c ? \"preset-tonal-primary\" : \"\"}`}\n\t\t\t\tonclick={() => setColor(c)}\n\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t{#if color === c}<CheckIcon size={14} />{/if}\n\t\t\t\t<span>{c}</span>\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t{/each}\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Input Chips\n\nRepresent user input values such as contacts or search terms.\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport XIcon from \"@lucide/svelte/icons/x\";\n</script>\n\n<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 w-full max-w-md p-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n\t\t<span class=\"text-sm opacity-60\">To</span>\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t\t<button class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<span>jane@email.com</span>\n\t\t\t<XIcon size={14} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<span>dave@email.com</span>\n\t\t\t<XIcon size={14} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Suggestion Chips\n\nRepresent a canned set of suggested options for a user to choose from.\n\n```svelte\n<div class=\"card preset-filled-surface-100-900 w-full max-w-md p-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n\t\t<span class=\"text-sm opacity-60\">Rating</span>\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t\t<button class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<span>Bad</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<span>Good</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600\">\n\t\t\t<span>Awesome</span>\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<!-- --- -->\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Disabled\n\nWhen applied to a `<button>` element, you can use the `disabled` attribute.\n\n```astro\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-400-600 hover:preset-tonal\" disabled>\n\tChip\n</button>\n\n```\n\n## Presets\n\nProvides full support of [Presets](/docs/\\[framework]/tailwind-utilities/presets).\n\n```astro\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-brand\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-brand\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-brand\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<hr class=\"hr\" />\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-primary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-primary\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-primary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-secondary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-secondary\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-secondary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-tertiary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-tertiary\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-tertiary-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-success-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-success\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-success-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-warning-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-warning\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-warning-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-error-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-error\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-error-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-filled-surface-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-tonal-surface\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"chip preset-outlined-surface-500\">\n\t\t\tChip\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n",
